Package: libcares-rs2
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Pre-Depends: ${misc:Pre-Depends}
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: asynchronous DNS resolver library (Rust, c-ares-compatible) - runtime
 cares-rs is a Rust reimplementation of the c-ares asynchronous DNS resolver
 library, exposing the c-ares 1.34 C ABI. It is parallel-installable and does
 not replace the system c-ares; link against it explicitly with -lcares_rs.
 .
 This package contains the shared library (libcares_rs.so.2).

Package: libcares-rs-dev
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Section: libdevel
Depends: libcares-rs2 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: asynchronous DNS resolver library (Rust, c-ares-compatible) - development
 cares-rs is a Rust reimplementation of the c-ares asynchronous DNS resolver
 library, exposing the c-ares 1.34 C ABI. It is parallel-installable and does
 not replace the system c-ares; link against it explicitly with -lcares_rs.
 .
 This package contains the development files: the C header (installed as
 <cares-rs/ares.h>), the static library, the pkg-config metadata (libcares-rs),
 the CMake package configuration, and the .so development symlink.
